 0 3px var(--brand-light)\"></i><div style=\"position:absolute;top:4px;left:50%;width:100%;height:2px;background:var(--border)\"></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text);margin-top:8px\">Development</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">In progress</div></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;position:relative\"><i style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--border)\"></i><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Launch</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">TBD</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"tl-demo\"><span class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dot\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i></span><span class=\"tl-cont\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\"><b>包裹已签收</b></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"time\"><span>07-20 14:32</span></span></span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"tl-demo\"><span class=\"tl-item\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dot\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i></span><span class=\"tl-cont\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"title\"><b>Package has been signed for</b></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"time\"><span>07-20 14:32</span></span></span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"时间轴","en":"Timeline","desc":"轴线 + 一串节点的容器","desc_en":"The axis and container for a list of events"},{"key":"dot","cn":"节点圆点","en":"Dot","desc":"辅助标记节点位置和状态，具体结果仍由文字或图标说明","desc_en":"Use markers to show position and status; explain the outcome with text or icons"},{"key":"title","cn":"节点内容","en":"Content","desc":"这一步发生了什么","desc_en":"What happened at this step"},{"key":"time","cn":"时间戳","en":"Timestamp","desc":"具体到分钟更好","desc_en":"Include the time to the minute when it matters"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础竖排","en":"Vertical","demo":"<div class=\"tl-demo\"><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>已发货</b><span>07-19 09:15</span></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>已下单</b><span>07-18 20:02</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tl-demo\"><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>Shipping</b><span>07-19 09:15</span></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>Order placed</b><span>07-18 20:02</span></div></div></div>","when":"默认款，事件多就竖着往下排","when_en":"Use the vertical layout when there are many events"},{"cn":"带状态","en":"Status","demo":"<div class=\"tl-demo\"><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>部署成功</b></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot doing\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>构建中…</b></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot fail\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>测试失败</b></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tl-demo\"><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot done\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>Deployed successfully</b></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot doing\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>Building...</b></div></div><div class=\"tl-item\"><i class=\"tl-dot fail\"></i><div class=\"tl-cont\"><b>Test failed</b></div></div></div>","when":"节点用文字说明结果，并以颜色辅助区分","when_en":"Use text to describe outcomes and color only as a supporting cue"},{"cn":"水平式","en":"Horizontal","demo":"<div class=\"tl-h\"><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"done\"></i><b>立项</b><span>03-01</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"done\"></i><b>设计</b><span>04-10</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"doing\"></i><b>开发</b><span>进行中</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i></i><b>上线</b><span>待定</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tl-h\"><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"done\"></i><b>Project approval</b><span>03-01</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"done\"></i><b>Design</b><span>04-10</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i class=\"doing\"></i><b>Development</b><span>In progress</span></div><div class=\"tl-h-item\"><i></i><b>Launch</b><span>To be determined</span></div></div>","when":"节点少、横向空间够，看整体进度","when_en":"When there are few steps and enough room to show progress horizontally"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>物流 / 订单进度</b>：已下单 → 已发货 → 已签收","m":"timeline-order"},{"t":"<b>审批 / 操作记录</b>：谁在什么时候做了什么","m":"timeline-log"},{"t":"<b>更新日志</b>：版本记录按时间排开","m":"timeline-changelog"},{"t":"节点有<b>成败状态</b>时，用文字或图标说明结果，颜色只作辅助","m":"timeline-status"}],"dont":[{"t":"需要用户依次完成的任务应使用 {c:steps}，而不是时间轴","m":"tabs-steps","bad":true},{"t":"时间顺序不重要的普通消息应使用 {c:list}","m":"timeline-plain","bad":true},{"t":"内容<b>没有时间先后</b>，不适合使用时间轴","m":"timeline-notime","bad":true},{"t":"节点包含大段图文时，平铺为 {c:card} 通常更易阅读","m":"timeline-heavy","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"工单详情要记录“谁在什么时候创建、转交和关闭了工单”，这些事情都已经发生。怎样展示更合适？","options":[{"id":"ordered-event-timeline","label":"用时间轴按统一方向排列事件，并写清人物、时间和动作","feedback":"这些是带时间先后的历史事件，时间轴能同时表达顺序和每次变化的具体内容。","correct":true},{"id":"completion-steps","label":"用步骤条显示“创建、转交、关闭”，让用户逐步点亮每个阶段","feedback":"步骤条通常引导待完成流程，而这里需要还原已经发生的记录和责任人。","correct":false},{"id":"unordered-activity-list","label":"用普通列表展示三条动作，并按动作名称排序方便查找","feedback":"按名称排序会丢失事件先后，用户无法判断工单状态是怎样变化的。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A ticket detail page records who created, transferred, and closed the ticket and when. All events already happened. How should they appear?","options":[{"id":"ordered-event-timeline","label":"Use a timeline with one direction and show the person, time, and action for each event","feedback":"These are historical events with temporal order, so a timeline expresses both sequence and each specific change.","correct":true},{"id":"completion-steps","label":"Use a stepper for Create, Transfer, and Close and let users mark each stage complete","feedback":"A stepper usually guides work still to be completed, while this page must reconstruct past records and responsibility.","correct":false},{"id":"unordered-activity-list","label":"Use a regular list and sort the actions alphabetically for easier lookup","feedback":"Alphabetical ordering removes event sequence, so users cannot see how the ticket state changed.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把工单操作记录做成时间轴，统一从新到旧或从旧到新排列，每个节点显示操作者、时间、动作和结果。不要做成待办步骤条；用转交失败和重新打开事件验证顺序仍清楚。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Turn the ticket audit trail into a timeline ordered consistently newest-first or oldest-first. Show actor, time, action, and outcome at every node. Do not present it as pending steps, and test failed transfer and reopened events."}},"scenes":["物流跟踪","审批流转记录","版本更新日志","项目里程碑"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Shipping progress","m":"timeline-order"},{"t":"Approval history","m":"timeline-log"},{"t":"Release notes","m":"timeline-changelog"},{"t":"A record of events over time","m":"timeline-status"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use a timeline for items with no meaningful order","m":"tabs-steps","bad":true},{"t":"Switch time direction halfway through","m":"timeline-plain","bad":true},{"t":"Rely on dot color without status text","m":"timeline-notime","bad":true},{"t":"Pack long, unrelated documents into each event","m":"timeline-heavy","bad":true}],"scenes":["Order tracking","Approval record","Project history","Release log"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Waybill SF1024888</b><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">In transit</span></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-sc\">\n        <div class=\"tl-sc-item doing\"><b>In transit · Shenzhen Nanshan Transfer Center</b><span>Today 09:15</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-sc-item ok\"><b>Accepted · Hangzhou Yuhang outlet</b><span>Yesterday 20:02</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tl-sc-item\"><b>Order placed</b><span>Yesterday 18:40</spa